OL,3,GNEWSACommunity payback order for woman
OL,4,Awho created chlorine gas in her home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who caused a street to be
OL,7,Fevacuated after creating chlorine gas
OL,8,Fin her Glasgow home has been handed a
OL,9,Fcommunity payback order.
OL,11,FConnie Stevenson, 27, mixed bottles of
OL,12,Fhousehold substances at a property on
OL,13,FLenzie Terrace in Springburn on 31 May.
OL,15,FNearby residents were forced to leave
OL,16,Ftheir homes after the alarm was raised
OL,17,Fand those who entered the property had
OL,18,Fto take decontamination showers.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
